## 🏗️ Project Structure

### Directory Organization

**Respect this structure when creating files:**

```
dev-infra/
├── templates/              # Project templates
│   ├── standard-project/   # Standard application template (all commands)
│   └── learning-project/   # Learning/tutorial template (all commands)
├── scripts/                # Automation scripts
│   ├── new-project.sh      # Template generator
│   └── validate-templates.sh
├── docs/                   # User documentation
├── admin/                  # Dev-infra project management
│   ├── planning/           # Template evolution planning
│   │   ├── features/       # Template feature development
│   │   ├── releases/       # Version management
│   │   ├── commands/       # Cursor commands integration
│   │   └── opportunities/  # Learnings and improvements
│   ├── research/           # Template design decisions
│   ├── decisions/          # Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)
│   └── notes/              # Template insights and examples
├── tests/                  # Template validation tests
├── .cursor/                # Cursor IDE configuration
│   ├── commands/           # Workflow automation commands
│   └── rules/              # AI assistant rules (this file)
└── README.md               # Project hub
```

### File Location Rules

1. **Template Files** → `templates/[type]/`
2. **Template Planning** → `admin/planning/features/[feature-name]/`
3. **Release Management** → `admin/planning/releases/vX.Y.Z/`
4. **Command Integration** → `admin/planning/commands/`
5. **Research Documents** → `admin/research/[category]/`
6. **Architecture Decisions (ADRs)** → `admin/decisions/`
7. **User Documentation** → `docs/`
8. **Cursor Commands** → `.cursor/commands/`

